{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15114801","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15114801","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1511480101:0":{"text":"꼬... 꼬리가 두 개다!","source_cn":"你、你有两条尾巴！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEA2365C5181C81E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1511480102:0":{"text":"그럼 아저씨가 붉은 사냥제에서 짱 먹은 그 아저씨겠네요?! ","source_cn":"这么说，你是猎血节的勇士！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9E48F2ED3B88D9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1511480103:0":{"text":"우와...! 붉은 사냥제에서 어떻게 이긴 거예요?","source_cn":"哇啊——你是怎么赢得猎血节的？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04685A069087B947","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1511480104:0":{"text":"다들 숲의 짐승이 엄청 흉악해서 아저씨 빼고 다른 사람들은 다 죽었다고 했는데, 그게 진짜예요? ","source_cn":"他们都说丛林里的野兽非常凶恶，只有你能打败它们，其他人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x182CC975459A621A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1511480105:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1511480106:0":{"text":"신이 자신의 신도를 죽일 거라고 생각하나?","source_cn":"你们相信神明会杀死自己的信徒吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89FE77A86A2DFA4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1511480107:0":{"text":"그럴 리가요! 신께서 우리에게 얼~마나 잘 해주시는데요!","source_cn":"怎么可能？神对我们这么好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC01C9145B6E8A21F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1511480108:0":{"text":"음... 다른 신은 그럴 수 있지만, 짐승의 군주님은 절대 그러지 않으실 거예요!","source_cn":"唔，其他神或许会，但兽群之主肯定不会！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B967301B4E0C16B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1511480109:0":{"text":"...나도 원래는 믿지 않았어.","source_cn":"……我原本也不信。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x345B4B8A6031EEE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1511480110:0":{"text":"그냥 다른 사람들은 모두 전사했다고 생각해. 꼬맹이들은 더 알 필요 없으니.","source_cn":"就当其他人都是战死的吧。你们没必要知道更多。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x253CEB1F5960E2BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:兽人阿步":{"text":"루나애니 아보","source":"兽人阿步","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:兽人思":{"text":"루나애니 싱크